data: {"id": "7458d33e7fe44df2-thinking-parallel_evidence-1197", "run_id": "7458d33e7fe44df2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的真实工具结果，汇总证据如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n*   **Pod**: `workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6` (UID: `3fce1c76-f1ba-4e68-8f05-a50d78a131c9`)，隶属于 `aiops-case-09` 命名空间。\n*   **控制器**: `Deployment/workload` -> `ReplicaSet/workload-5f4fb9ff45`。\n*   **节点**: 调度在 `node2` 上，状态为 `Running`（非 NotReady/Unreachable）。\n*   **启动时间**: 2026-09-03T17:53:37Z 创建，无 `deletionTimestamp`，当前未终止。\n*   **重启次数**: 0 次（容器状态 `restart_count: 0`）。\n\n### 2. 支持“NotReady”原因的事实\n*   **Readiness Probe 失败 (直接原因)**:\n    *   `kubectl_events` 和 `kubectl_des", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788465532876, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

